<doc id="199281" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=199281" title="Jeblugan kacerdhasan gawéyan">
Jeblugan kacerdhasan gawéyan

Jeblugan kacerdhasan gawéyan utawa jeblugan AI, yaiku mangsa ing ngendi &lt;a href="kacerdhasan%20gaw%C3%A9yan"&gt;kacerdhasan gawéyan&lt;/a&gt; thumukul kanthi rikat. Jeblugan iki prastawa sing isih lumaku terus sing mulané wiwit 2010 nganti 2016, nanging katon sansaya tambah rikat ing tahun 2020-an. Tuladhané kalebu tèknologi &lt;a href="kacerdhasan%20gaw%C3%A9yan%20mangriptayasa"&gt;kacerdhasan gawéyan mangriptayasa&lt;/a&gt;, kaya &lt;a href="modh%C3%A8l%20basa%20gedh%C3%A9"&gt;modhèl basa gedhé&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kagunan%20rupa%20kacerdhasan%20gaw%C3%A9yan"&gt;kacerdhasan gawéyan pangriptayasa gambar&lt;/a&gt; (AI image generator) dening parusahan kaya &lt;a href="OpenAI"&gt;OpenAI&lt;/a&gt;, uga kamajuan ing bab èlmiah, kaya &lt;a href="Titikira%20tatasungsun%20prot%C3%A8in"&gt;titikira linempit protèin&lt;/a&gt; (protein folding prediction) sing dipanggedhèni dening Google DeepMind. Mangsa iki kadhangkala karan mangsa semi AI, kanggo mbedakaké karo mangsa AI sadurungé. Lan kanggo taun 2025, ChatGPT minangka &lt;a href="Pratelan%20sasana%20web%20akeh%20dh%C3%A9w%C3%A9%20didayohi"&gt;sasana web akeh dhéwé didhayohi nomer 5&lt;/a&gt; sadonya sawisé Google, &lt;a href="YouTube"&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Facebook"&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Instagram"&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;. 

