<doc id="199315" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=199315" title="Filem kècu">
Filem kècu

Film kècu (&lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;basa Inggris&lt;/a&gt;: heist film) yaiku &lt;a href="Lagak"&gt;sublagak&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="filem%20durjana"&gt;filem durjana&lt;/a&gt; sing punjering crita ana ing bab ngrantam, tumindak, lan apa-apa waé kahanan sawisé linakon &lt;a href="rerampogan"&gt;rerampogan&lt;/a&gt; gedhé-gedhèn.
Sawijiné filem kècu wiwitan yaiku &lt;a href="The%20Asphalt%20Jungle"&gt;The Asphalt Jungle&lt;/a&gt; (1950), sing kapacak ing karangan cekak (essay) Film Genre 2000 minangka "ngondhangaké lagak kasebut meh dhéwékan marang fefileman ilen utama". Lagak iki nuduhaké para parampok ing ngendi jugaré saben wong pungkasané njalari jugaré kabeh tumindak rerampokan. Film mèmper sing piguna lakon iki yaiku &lt;a href="Armored%20Car%20Robbery"&gt;Armored Car Robbery&lt;/a&gt; (1950), &lt;a href="The%20Killing"&gt;The Killing&lt;/a&gt; (1956), lan &lt;a href="The%20Getaway"&gt;The Getaway&lt;/a&gt; (1972). Ing taun 1990-an, filem-filem rerampokan wiwit "njajal lan nggothak-gathuk pakem iki," nyamboraké bebakal-bebakal liya kaya dhagelan menyang critané.

</doc>
<doc id="199316" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=199316" title="Now You See Me: Now You Don't">
Now You See Me: Now You Don't

Now You See Me: Now You Don't yaiku &lt;a href="filem%20k%C3%A8cu"&gt;filem kècu&lt;/a&gt; Amerika taun 2025 sing disutradharai dening &lt;a href="Ruben%20Fleischer"&gt;Ruben Fleischer&lt;/a&gt;. Naskah film iki tinulis dening &lt;a href="Michael%20Lesslie"&gt;Michael Lesslie&lt;/a&gt;, duo panulis &lt;a href="Paul%20Wernick"&gt;Paul Wernick&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Rhett%20Reese"&gt;Rhett Reese&lt;/a&gt;, uga &lt;a href="Seth%20Grahame-Smith"&gt;Seth Grahame-Smith&lt;/a&gt;. Filem iki adhedhasar crita dening &lt;a href="Eric%20Warren%20Singer"&gt;Eric Warren Singer&lt;/a&gt; lan Lesslie. Filem iki minangka sekuel saka filem &lt;a href="Now%20You%20See%20Me%202"&gt;Now You See Me 2&lt;/a&gt; (2016) lan minangka filem katelu ing seri film Now You See Me. Para juru paraga ing filem iki ana &lt;a href="Jesse%20Eisenberg"&gt;Jesse Eisenberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Woody%20Harrelson"&gt;Woody Harrelson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dave%20Franco"&gt;Dave Franco&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Isla%20Fisher"&gt;Isla Fisher&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lizzy%20Caplan"&gt;Lizzy Caplan&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Morgan%20Freeman"&gt;Morgan Freeman&lt;/a&gt; sing uga ana ing filem-filem sadurungé, banjur digabung karo para juru paraga anyar kaya &lt;a href="Justice%20Smith"&gt;Justice Smith&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dominic%20Sessa"&gt;Dominic Sessa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ariana%20Greenblatt"&gt;Ariana Greenblatt&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Rosamund%20Pike"&gt;Rosamund Pike&lt;/a&gt;.
Now You See Me: Now You Don't tayang pradhana ing Harbour Club ing &lt;a href="Amsterdam"&gt;Amsterdam&lt;/a&gt;, Walanda, tanggal 11 November 2025, lan metu ing Amerika Serikat tanggal 14 November 2025, dening &lt;a href="Lionsgate"&gt;Lionsgate&lt;/a&gt;. Filem iki entuk pangasilan kasar $211 yuta ing saindenging jagad lan piwoleh ulasan lumayan becik saka para pangritik sing nganggep filem iki luwih apik tinimbang filem-filem sadurungé. Sekuel saka filem ini isih digarap. 

