<doc id="199661" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=199661" title="Elizabeth McGovern">
Elizabeth McGovern

Elizabeth Lee McGovern (lair 19 Juli 1961) iku aktris Amérika Sarékat. Dhèwèké wus tau nampa bebungah &lt;a href="Screen%20Actors%20Guild%20Award"&gt;Screen Actors Guild Award&lt;/a&gt;, telung nominasi &lt;a href="Golden%20Globe%20Awards"&gt;Golden Globe Awards&lt;/a&gt;, lan siji nominasi &lt;a href="Academy%20Awards"&gt;Academy Award&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké lair ing &lt;a href="%20Evanston%2C%20Illinois"&gt; Evanston, Illinois&lt;/a&gt; ing tanggal 18 Juli 1961, nanging Elizabeth McGovern akèhé manggon ing Los Angeles ing awal uripé. Sawisé sekolah ing American Conservatory Theater lan Juilliard School, film kapisané yaiku &lt;a href="Ordinary%20People"&gt;Ordinary People&lt;/a&gt; (1980).
Kanggo paragané minangka Evelyn Nesbit ing adhaptasi film &lt;a href="Ragtime"&gt;Ragtime&lt;/a&gt; (1981), dhèwèké nampa nominasi kanggo Academy Award kanggo Aktris Panyengkuyung Apik Dhéwé. Dhèwèké banjur mainanké paraga pokok sawetara film papan dhuwur, kalebu &lt;a href="Once%20Upon%20a%20Time%20in%20America"&gt;Once Upon a Time in America&lt;/a&gt; (1984), &lt;a href="She%27s%20Having%20a%20Baby"&gt;She's Having a Baby&lt;/a&gt; (1987), &lt;a href="The%20Bedroom%20Window%20%28film%201987%29"&gt;The Bedroom Window&lt;/a&gt; (1987), &lt;a href="The%20Handmaid%27s%20Tale%20%28film%29"&gt;The Handmaid's Tale&lt;/a&gt; (1990), and &lt;a href="The%20Wings%20of%20the%20Dove%20%28film%201997%29"&gt;The Wings of the Dove&lt;/a&gt; (1997).
Ing taun 2007, McGovern, sawisé pirang-pirang taun sinau gitar, mbangun grup musik Sadie and the Hotheads, sing wis ngrilis patang album hwiwit taun 2016. Dhèwèké éntuk pawigatèn internasional sabanjuré déné olèhé maragakaké Cora Crawley, Countess of Grantham, ing sérial drama Inggris &lt;a href="Downton%20Abbey"&gt;Downton Abbey&lt;/a&gt; (2010–2015), sing ndadèkaké dhèwèké dinominasèkaké kanggo Emmy Award lan Golden Globe Award. Dhèwèké mbalèni paragané minangka Cora ing film-film sabanjuré &lt;a href="Downton%20Abbey%20%28film%29"&gt;Downton Abbey&lt;/a&gt; (2019), ' (2022) lan ' (2025).
<h2>Urip awal</h2>
