<doc id="199689" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=199689" title="Maggie Smith">
Maggie Smith

Dame Margaret Natalie Smith (28 Dhésèmber 1934 – 27 Sèptèmber 2024) iku sawijiné aktris Britani Agung. Dhèwèké ditepungi minangka kapinterané sarkasme ing paraga kumidhi lan dramatis, dhèwèké ndarbèni karir sing dawa panggung lan kelir sajroné luwih saka pitung dasawarsa lan dhèwèké iku salah sawijiné aktris Britani sing misuwur lan prodhuktif. Dhèwèké olèh akèh bebungah, kalebu bebungah &lt;a href="Academy%20Awards"&gt;Academy Awards&lt;/a&gt; (Oscar) loro, limang bebungah &lt;a href="BAFTA%20Awards"&gt;BAFTA Awards&lt;/a&gt;, patang bebungah &lt;a href="Emmy%20Awards"&gt;Emmy Awards&lt;/a&gt;, telung bebungah &lt;a href="Golden%20Globe%20Awards"&gt;Golden Globe Awards&lt;/a&gt; lan bebungah &lt;a href="Tony%20Award"&gt;Tony Award&lt;/a&gt; siji, saha nominasi kanggo enem bebungah &lt;a href="Olivier%20Awards"&gt;Olivier Awards&lt;/a&gt;. Maggie Smith iku salah sawijiné juru paraga sing tau olèh &lt;a href="Triple%20Crown%20of%20Acting"&gt;Triple Crown of Acting&lt;/a&gt;.
Smith miwiti kariré ing panggung minangka mahasiswi, lain main ing &lt;a href="Oxford%20Playhouse"&gt;Oxford Playhouse&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1952, lan main kanthi profésional kapisan ing &lt;a href="Broadway%20theatre"&gt;Broadway&lt;/a&gt; ing New Faces of '56 (Rai-Rai Anyar saka 56).Sajroné sawetara dasawarsa sabanjuré, Smith nuduhaké awaké dhéwé minangka salah sawijiné juru paraga téater Britani sing wigat dhéwé, lan nyambut gawé kanggo &lt;a href="Royal%20National%20Theatre"&gt;National Theatre&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Royal%20Shakespeare%20Company"&gt;Royal Shakespeare Company&lt;/a&gt;. Ing Broadway, dhèwèké olèh bebungah &lt;a href="Tony%20Award%20for%20Best%20Actress%20in%20a%20Play"&gt;Tony Award for Best Actress in a Play&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="Lettice%20and%20Lovage"&gt;Lettice and Lovage&lt;/a&gt; (1990). Dhèwèké uga tau olèh nominasi kanggo sandiwara &lt;a href="Private%20Lives"&gt;Private Lives&lt;/a&gt; (1975) anggitané &lt;a href="No%C3%ABl%20Coward"&gt;Noël Coward&lt;/a&gt; lan karyané &lt;a href="Tom%20Stoppard"&gt;Tom Stoppard&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Night%20and%20Day%20%28sandiwara%29"&gt;Night and Day&lt;/a&gt; (1979).
Maggie Smith menangaké rong bebungah Academy Award: siji kanggo kategori "Aktris Becik Dhéwé" kanggo &lt;a href="The%20Prime%20of%20Miss%20Jean%20Brodie%20%28film%29"&gt;The Prime of Miss Jean Brodie&lt;/a&gt; (1969) lan siji kanggo "Aktris Panyengkuyung Apik Dhéwé" kanggo film &lt;a href="California%20Suite%20%28film%29"&gt;California Suite&lt;/a&gt; (1978). She was Oscar-nominated for &lt;a href="Othello%20%281965%20British%20film%29"&gt;Othello&lt;/a&gt; (1965), &lt;a href="Travels%20with%20My%20Aunt%20%28film%29"&gt;Travels with My Aunt&lt;/a&gt; (1972), &lt;a href="A%20Room%20with%20a%20View%20%281985%20film%29"&gt;A Room with a View&lt;/a&gt; (1985) and &lt;a href="Gosford%20Park"&gt;Gosford Park&lt;/a&gt; (2001). Dhèwèké maragaké &lt;a href="Minerva%20McGonagall"&gt;Profèsor Minerva McGonagall&lt;/a&gt; ing film-film &lt;a href="Harry%20Potter%20%28s%C3%A9rial%20film%29"&gt;Harry Potter&lt;/a&gt; (2001–2011). Dhèwèké uga main ing &lt;a href="Death%20on%20the%20Nile%20%28film%201978%29"&gt;Death on the Nile&lt;/a&gt; (1978), &lt;a href="Hook%20%28film%29"&gt;Hook&lt;/a&gt; (1991), &lt;a href="Sister%20Act"&gt;Sister Act&lt;/a&gt; (1992), &lt;a href="The%20Secret%20Garden%20%28film%201993%29"&gt;The Secret Garden&lt;/a&gt; (1993), &lt;a href="The%20Best%20Exotic%20Marigold%20Hotel"&gt;The Best Exotic Marigold Hotel&lt;/a&gt; (2012), &lt;a href="Quartet%20%28film%202012%29"&gt;Quartet&lt;/a&gt; (2012) and &lt;a href="The%20Lady%20in%20the%20Van"&gt;The Lady in the Van&lt;/a&gt; (2015).
Maggie Smith olèh kawigatèn internasional manèh lan dadi kawentar olèhé maragakaké &lt;a href="Violet%20Crawley"&gt;Violet Crawley&lt;/a&gt; ing drama historis Britani &lt;a href="Downton%20Abbey"&gt;Downton Abbey&lt;/a&gt; (2010–2015). Paraga iki mènèhi awaké telung bebungah &lt;a href="Primetime%20Emmy%20Awards"&gt;Primetime Emmy Awards&lt;/a&gt;; sadurungé dhèwèké wis tau menangaké siji kanggo film &lt;a href="HBO"&gt;HBO&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="My%20House%20in%20Umbria"&gt;My House in Umbria&lt;/a&gt; (2003). Salawasé kariré dhèwèké tau nampa akèh bebungah pamemulé, kalebu saka &lt;a href="British%20Film%20Institute%20Fellowship"&gt;British Film Institute Fellowship&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1993, &lt;a href="BAFTA%20Fellowship"&gt;BAFTA Fellowship&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1996 lan &lt;a href="Society%20of%20London%20Theatre%20Special%20Award"&gt;Society of London Theatre Special Award&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 2010. Maggie Smith didadèkaké dame déning &lt;a href="Queen%20Elizabeth%20II"&gt;Ratu Elizabeth II&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1990.
