<doc id="199820" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=199820" title="Hugh Dancy">
Hugh Dancy

Hugh Michael Horace Dancy (lair 19 Juni 1975) iku sawijiné aktor Inggris, sing dadi kawentar minangka main ing adhaptasi télévisi saka roman &lt;a href="David%20Copperfield"&gt;David Copperfield&lt;/a&gt; (2000), main minangka Kurt Schmid ing &lt;a href="Black%20Hawk%20Down"&gt;Black Hawk Down&lt;/a&gt; (2001) lan Prince Charmont ing &lt;a href="Ella%20Enchanted"&gt;Ella Enchanted&lt;/a&gt; (2004). Paraga liyané ing film kalebu Joe Conner ing &lt;a href="Shooting%20Dogs"&gt;Shooting Dogs&lt;/a&gt; (2005), Grigg Harris ing &lt;a href="The%20Jane%20Austen%20Book%20Club"&gt;The Jane Austen Book Club&lt;/a&gt; (2007), Luke Brandon ing &lt;a href="Confessions%20of%20a%20Shopaholic"&gt;Confessions of a Shopaholic&lt;/a&gt; (2009), Adam Raki in &lt;a href="Adam%20%28film%202009%29"&gt;Adam&lt;/a&gt; (2009) lan Ted ing &lt;a href="Martha%20Marcy%20May%20Marlene"&gt;Martha Marcy May Marlene&lt;/a&gt; (2011). Ing télévisi, dhèwèké maragakaké profiler para durjana Will Graham ing sérial NBC television Hannibal (2013–2015), Cal Roberts ing sérial Hulu original The Path (2016–2018) lan Robert Devereux, 2nd Earl of Essex, ing miniséri Channel 4 Elizabeth I (2005); paraga iki mènèhi awaké nominasi Primetime Emmy Award. Wiwit taun 2022 Dancy maragakaké Nolan Price ing revival sérial NBC Law &amp; Order" (2022–saiki).

