<doc id="199956" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=199956" title="The Rolling Stones">
The Rolling Stones

The Rolling Stones iku grup musik rock asal &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; sing diadegaké ing &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt; taun 1962. Grup iki kalebu salah siji band paling pengaruh ing sajarah musik rock lan dadi pérangan penting saka gerakan British Invasion ing Amérika Sarékat taun 1960-an.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
<h3>Wiwitan (1962–1966)</h3>
Sajarah.
Wiwitan (1962–1966).
The Rolling Stones wiwitané main musik blues Amérika, mligi dipengaruhi déning Muddy Waters lan Chuck Berry. Jenengé dijupuk saka lagu “Rollin’ Stone” kagungan Muddy Waters. Ing periode iki band iki dikenal kanthi citra luwih liar lan pemberontak tinimbang band Inggris liya kaya &lt;a href="The%20Beatles"&gt;The Beatles&lt;/a&gt;.
<h3>Masa Keemasan (1967–1974)</h3>
Masa Keemasan (1967–1974).
Ing pungkasan taun 1960-an nganti awal 1970-an, The Rolling Stones ngetokaké album-album penting kayata:
<ul>
<li>Aftermath (1966)</li>
<li>Beggars Banquet (1968)</li>
<li>Let It Bleed (1969)</li>
<li>Sticky Fingers (1971)</li>
<li>Exile on Main St. (1972)</li>
</ul>
Lagu-lagu kaya “(I Can’t Get No) Satisfaction”, “Paint It Black”, lan “Gimme Shelter” dadi lagu klasik rock donya.
<h3>Era Stadion (1975–1990-an)</h3>
Era Stadion (1975–1990-an).
Sawisé &lt;a href="Ronnie%20Wood"&gt;Ronnie Wood&lt;/a&gt; gabung taun 1975, band iki saya misuwur minangka band tur stadion paling gedhé ing donya. Album penting ing periode iki kalebu:
<ul>
<li>Some Girls (1978)</li>
<li>Tattoo You (1981)</li>
<li>Steel Wheels (1989)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Era Modern (2000–saiki)</h3>
Era Modern (2000–saiki).
Band iki tetep aktif nganti abad kaping 21. Album modern kalebu:
<ul>
<li>A Bigger Bang (2005)</li>
<li>Blue &amp; Lonesome (2016)</li>
<li>Hackney Diamonds (2023)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Anggota</h2>
<h3>Anggota saiki</h3>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Mick%20Jagger"&gt;Mick Jagger&lt;/a&gt; – vokal</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Keith%20Richards"&gt;Keith Richards&lt;/a&gt; – gitar</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Ronnie%20Wood"&gt;Ronnie Wood&lt;/a&gt; – gitar</li>
</ul>
<h3>Mantan anggota</h3>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Brian%20Jones"&gt;Brian Jones&lt;/a&gt; – gitar (1962–1969)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Charlie%20Watts"&gt;Charlie Watts&lt;/a&gt; – drum (1963–2021)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Bill%20Wyman"&gt;Bill Wyman&lt;/a&gt; – bass (1962–1993)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Pangaruh lan Warisan</h2>
Pangaruh lan Warisan.
The Rolling Stones nduwèni pangaruh gedhé marang perkembangan musik rock. Dheweke kalebu grup sing paling suksès sacara komersial kanthi penjualan luwih saka 250 yuta rekaman ing saindenging donya. Band iki mlebu ing Rock and Roll Hall of Fame taun 1989.
