<doc id="199957" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=199957" title="Ronnie Wood">
Ronnie Wood

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Ronald David Wood (lair 1 Juni 1947) iku musisi rock asal Inggris sing paling kawentar minangka gitaris &lt;a href="The%20Rolling%20Stones"&gt;The Rolling Stones&lt;/a&gt; wiwit taun 1975. Sadurungé, dhèwèké uga dadi anggota &lt;a href="Faces%20%28band%29"&gt;Faces&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="The%20Jeff%20Beck%20Group"&gt;The Jeff Beck Group&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Urip Awal</h2>
Urip Awal.
Wood lair ing &lt;a href="London%20Borough%20of%20Hillingdon"&gt;London Borough of Hillingdon&lt;/a&gt;, Inggris. Dhèwèké tuwuh ing Yiewsley lan sekolah ing West Drayton. Keluargané nduwèni latar belakang seniman; sedulur-seduluré, &lt;a href="Art%20Wood"&gt;Art Wood&lt;/a&gt; lan Ted Wood, uga seniman lan musisi. Ronnie sinau seni ing &lt;a href="University%20of%20West%20London"&gt;Ealing College of Art&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir Musik</h2>
<h3>1960-an</h3>
Karir Musik.
1960-an.
Karir profesionalé diwiwiti taun 1964 minangka gitaris utama &lt;a href="The%20Birds%20%28band%29"&gt;The Birds&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé grup bubar, dhèwèké gabung karo &lt;a href="The%20Jeff%20Beck%20Group"&gt;The Jeff Beck Group&lt;/a&gt; taun 1967 bareng &lt;a href="Rod%20Stewart"&gt;Rod Stewart&lt;/a&gt;. Album pentingé kalebu:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Truth%20%28Jeff%20Beck%20album%29"&gt;Truth&lt;/a&gt; (1968)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Beck-Ola"&gt;Beck-Ola&lt;/a&gt; (1969)</li>
</ul>
Taun 1969, Wood lan Stewart gabung karo mantan anggota &lt;a href="Small%20Faces"&gt;Small Faces&lt;/a&gt; lan mbentuk &lt;a href="Faces%20%28band%29"&gt;Faces&lt;/a&gt;. Grup iki sukses gedhé ing Britania Raya lan Éropah.
<h3>1970-an</h3>
1970-an.
Faces nerbitaké sawetara album sukses, kalebu:
<ul>
<li>A Nod Is as Good as a Wink... to a Blind Horse (1971)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Ooh%20La%20La%20%28Faces%20album%29"&gt;Ooh La La&lt;/a&gt; (1973)</li>
</ul>
Taun 1974 Wood nerbitaké album solo kapisané:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="I%27ve%20Got%20My%20Own%20Album%20to%20Do"&gt;I've Got My Own Album to Do&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
Sawisé &lt;a href="Mick%20Taylor"&gt;Mick Taylor&lt;/a&gt; metu saka Rolling Stones taun 1974, Wood diajak melu sesi rekaman album &lt;a href="Black%20and%20Blue"&gt;Black and Blue&lt;/a&gt; lan resmi dadi anggota band tanggal 23 April 1976.
<h3>1980–2000-an</h3>
1980–2000-an.
Wood tetep aktif karo Rolling Stones lan uga nerbitaké album solo:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Now%20Look"&gt;Now Look&lt;/a&gt; (1975)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Gimme%20Some%20Neck"&gt;Gimme Some Neck&lt;/a&gt; (1979)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1234%20%28Ron%20Wood%20album%29"&gt;1234&lt;/a&gt; (1981)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Slide%20on%20This"&gt;Slide on This&lt;/a&gt; (1992)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Not%20for%20Beginners"&gt;Not for Beginners&lt;/a&gt; (2002)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="I%20Feel%20Like%20Playing"&gt;I Feel Like Playing&lt;/a&gt; (2010)</li>
</ul>
Minangka anggota Rolling Stones, Wood mlebu &lt;a href="Rock%20and%20Roll%20Hall%20of%20Fame"&gt;Rock and Roll Hall of Fame&lt;/a&gt; taun 1989, lan mlebu manèh minangka anggota Faces taun 2012.
Taun 2023–2025, Wood tampil ing konser tribut kanggo &lt;a href="Jeff%20Beck"&gt;Jeff Beck&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Royal%20Albert%20Hall"&gt;Royal Albert Hall&lt;/a&gt; lan nggarap dokumenter anyar babagan Faces bareng Rod Stewart.
<h2>Seni Rupa</h2>
Seni Rupa.
Kajaba musisi, Wood uga pelukis profesional. Dhèwèké pameran karya seni ing manéka negara lan tau ngrancang sampul album &lt;a href="Crossroads%20%28Eric%20Clapton%20album%29"&gt;Crossroads&lt;/a&gt; kagungan &lt;a href="Eric%20Clapton"&gt;Eric Clapton&lt;/a&gt;. Wood nduwèni galeri seni jenengé "Scream" ing London.
<h2>Urip Pribadi</h2>
Urip Pribadi.
Wood wis nikah kaping telu:
<ol>
<li>Krissy Findlay (1971–1978)</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Jo%20Wood"&gt;Jo Wood&lt;/a&gt; (1985–2009)</<li>
<li>Sally Humphreys (nikah wiwit 2012)</<li>
</ol>
Dhèwèké nduwèni enem anak lan sawetara putu. Wood tau berjuang nglawan alkoholisme lan wis kaping pirang-pirang mlebu rehabilitasi. Taun 2017 dhèwèké didiagnosis kanker paru-paru lan dinyatakake waras sawisé operasi. Taun 2020 uga ngalami kanker sel cilik lan ngumumaké waras taun 2021.
