<doc id="200175" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200175" title="Tim Pigott-Smith">
Tim Pigott-Smith

Timothy Peter Pigott-Smith &lt;a href="Officer%20of%20the%20Order%20of%20the%20British%20Empire"&gt;OBE&lt;/a&gt; (13 Mèi 1946 – 7 April 2017) iku aktor lan pamgripta film lan télévisi Inggris. Kanggo paraga utama minangka Ronald Merrick ing sérial drama télévisi &lt;a href="The%20Jewel%20in%20the%20Crown%20%28s%C3%A9rial%20TV%29"&gt;The Jewel in the Crown&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké menangaké &lt;a href="British%20Academy%20Television%20Award%20kanggo%20Aktor%20Paling%20Apik"&gt;British Academy Television Award kanggo Aktor Paling Apik&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1985. Paraga télévisi liyané kalebu olèhé main ing &lt;a href="The%20Chief%20%28s%C3%A9rial%20TV%29"&gt;The Chief&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Midsomer%20Murders"&gt;Midsomer Murders&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Vice%20%28seri%20TV%29"&gt;The Vice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Suspicions%20of%20Mr%20Whicher"&gt;The Suspicions of Mr Whicher&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="King%20Charles%20III%20%28film%29"&gt;King Charles III&lt;/a&gt; lan rong crita &lt;a href="Doctor%20Who"&gt;Doctor Who&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Cakar%20Axos"&gt;Cakar Axos&lt;/a&gt; (1971) lan &lt;a href="Topeng%20Mandragora"&gt;Topeng Mandragora&lt;/a&gt; (1976)). Pigott-Smith tampil ing film-film kaya ta &lt;a href="Clash%20of%20the%20Titans%20%28film%201981%29"&gt;Clash of the Titans&lt;/a&gt; (1981), &lt;a href="Gangs%20of%20New%20York"&gt;Gangs of New York&lt;/a&gt; (2002), &lt;a href="Johnny%20English"&gt;Johnny English&lt;/a&gt; (2003), &lt;a href="Alexander%20%28film%202004%29"&gt;Alexander&lt;/a&gt; (2004), &lt;a href="V%20for%20Vendetta%20%28film%29"&gt;V for Vendetta&lt;/a&gt; (2005), &lt;a href="Quantum%20of%20Solace"&gt;Quantum of Solace&lt;/a&gt; (2008), &lt;a href="Red%202%20%28film%29"&gt;Red 2&lt;/a&gt; (2013) lan &lt;a href="Jupiter%20Ascending"&gt;Jupiter Ascending&lt;/a&gt; (2015).
<h2>Tilar donya</h2>
Tilar donya.
Pigott-Smith tilar donya tanggal 7 April 2017 nalika yuswa 70 taun amarga serangan jantung ing &lt;a href="Northampton"&gt;Northampton&lt;/a&gt;, ing ngendi dhèwèké lagi nyepakaké penampilan ing produksi tur Death of a Salesman sing bakal diwiwiti telung dina sawisé. Garwané, Pamela Miles, uga wiwitané dijadwalaké main ing drama iku nanging diundhur sawisé balungé tugel lan prelu dirawat operasi. Dhèwèké dikubur ing sisih wétan &lt;a href="Pasar%C3%A9yan%20Highgate"&gt;Pasaréyan Highgate&lt;/a&gt;.
