<doc id="200187" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200187" title="Nailoong">
Nailoong

Nailoong (&lt;a href="Pinyin"&gt;Pinyin&lt;/a&gt;: Nǎilóng) yaiku sawijining &lt;a href="karakter"&gt;karakter&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="dinosaurus"&gt;dinosaurus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="fiksi"&gt;fiktif&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="s%C3%A8ri%20animasi"&gt;sèri animasi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Nailoong%20%28s%C3%A8ri%20animasi%29"&gt;Nailoong&lt;/a&gt;, kang digawe dening &lt;a href="Xie%20Chengen"&gt;Xie Chengen&lt;/a&gt; lan diprodhuksi dening &lt;a href="Shenzhen%20Seventh%20Impressions%20Culture%20Media"&gt;Shenzhen Seventh Impressions Culture Media Co., Ltd.&lt;/a&gt;, sawijining &lt;a href="perusahaan"&gt;perusahaan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="prodhuksi%20film"&gt;prodhuksi film&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="tiongkok"&gt;tiongkok&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Merek dagang</h2>
Merek dagang.
Jeneng "Milk dragon" lan kabeh karya turunané yaiku &lt;a href="merek%20dagang"&gt;merek dagang&lt;/a&gt; sing wis kadhaptar. Ing tanggal 14 Oktober 2020, jeneng "Milk Dragon" didaftaraké dadi merek dagang.
<h2>Latar mburi</h2>
Latar mburi.
Inspirasi kanggo Milk Dragon asalé saka pengalaman mangsa cilik pangriptané, Xie Chengen. Nalika iku, Xie Chengen seneng karo dinosaurus lan nduweni impen pengin njelajah donya dinosaurus nalika wis diwasa. Mula dheweké nyiptakaké Milk Dragon ing taun 2020.
Jeneng "Nailoong" kanthi harfiah bisa diterjemahaké dadi "Naga Susu" (Milk Dragon), sing nuduhake sipaté sing lucu, lembut, lan nggemesaké kaya bayi utawa bocah cilik.
<h2>Popularitas</h2>
Popularitas.
Wiwit debut rilisé ing taun 2020, sèri iki wis melu kolaborasi karo sawetara &lt;a href="IP"&gt;IP&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="game"&gt;game&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu "&lt;a href="Honor%20of%20Kings"&gt;Honor of Kings&lt;/a&gt;". Nganti 26 Januari 2025, Nailoong nduweni luwih saka 22 yuta pengikut ing &lt;a href="Douyin"&gt;Douyin&lt;/a&gt; lan 1,86 milyar tayangan ing &lt;a href="Bilibili"&gt;Bilibili&lt;/a&gt;.
