<doc id="200289" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200289" title="Agnipraba">
Agnipraba

Agnipraba iku manggala raseksa &lt;a href="Alengka"&gt;Ngalengka&lt;/a&gt;, balane &lt;a href="Rahwana"&gt;Prabu Dasamuka&lt;/a&gt;. Wujude buta rambute suri (kaya rambute jaran), rupane kuning semu abang. Ana ing Ngalengka, dipercaya mandhegani wadyabala buta Ngalengka sabergada.
Ing lakon Brubuh Ngalengka, nalika weruh kanca-kancane padhadene manggala mati ing paprangan (kayata &lt;a href="Ditya%20Kala%20Pragongsa"&gt;Pragongsa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ditya%20Kala%20Bajramusthi"&gt;Bajramusthi&lt;/a&gt;), Agnipraba saya ndadi muringe. Sigra matak aji Lumbung Dahana, sanalika saka tutuke mijil geni mangalad-alad, banjur ngamuk barisaning &lt;a href="Wanara"&gt;kethek&lt;/a&gt;. Akeh bala kethek kang mati kobong. Kethek sing isih urip, padha mlayu sumingkir.
Weruh bala kethek padha sirna, &lt;a href="Anila"&gt;Patih Anila&lt;/a&gt; sigra mangsah yuda. Njebol watu sing gedhene sapeluk, banjur methukake pangamuke Agnipraba. Dadi perang tandhing rame. Wusanane Agnipraba pecah sirahe, diblegi watu dening Anila.
