<doc id="200306" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200306" title="Manon Bannerman">
Manon Bannerman

Meret Manon Sarpong Bannerman (lair 26 Juni 2002), utawa uga ditepungi minangka Manon waé, iku penyanyi Switserlan. Dhèwèké miwiti karièré déné olèhé main ing médhia sosial &lt;a href="Instagram"&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="TikTok"&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;. Minangka penyanyi, dhèwèké dadi artis Kulit Ireng kapisan sing nèken kontrak karo sawijiné label Hybe, lan ndhébut minangka anggota grup kanya &lt;a href="Katseye"&gt;Katseye&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 2024, lan kawangun sawisé kompetisi acara réaliti TV Dream Academy ing taun 2023.
<h2>Urip awal</h2>
Urip awal.
Bannerman lair tanggal 26 Juni 2002, in &lt;a href="Lucerne"&gt;Lucerne&lt;/a&gt;, Switserlan, ibuné wong Switserlan-Italu lan bapané wong &lt;a href="Ghana"&gt;Ghana&lt;/a&gt;. She was raised in &lt;a href="Zurich"&gt;Zurich&lt;/a&gt;, where she spent most of her childhood. She has one older sister. Dhèwèké bisa &lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;basa Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Jerman%20Switserlan"&gt;Jerman Switserlan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="basa%20Jerman"&gt;Jerman baken&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika umuré patang taun, dhèwèké wis kepéngin mentas ing panggung. Bapané ngarani awaké "&lt;a href="Beyonc%C3%A9"&gt;Beyoncé&lt;/a&gt;", madhakaké impèné kepénging dadi artis karo penyanyi Amérika Sarékat iki.
Jeneng jangkepé Meret Manon Sarpong Bannerman. While spending a year as an exchange student in &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles"&gt;Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, she began going by her middle name, "Manon", due to her classmates pronouncing her given name, "Meret", strangely. "Sarpong" is her Ghanaian name.
Bannerman lunga menyang sekolah #ALIH ing Zurich, sing nganggo gaya sinau artistik.
